    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming ran to the window and when he looked, it truly was! Lots of “goose feathers”…"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "一个小时后，妈妈见小明还在看着天上的雪，",
